{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic journey in the mystical world of Lana, where ancient secrets and formidable challenges await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a Vast and Mysterious World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse diverse landscapes, from sun-drenched deserts to enigmatic temples, each filled with hidden secrets and rich lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif4.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in Challenging Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve intricate puzzles that blend logic and creativity, unlocking pathways and uncovering the mysteries of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif6.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Diverse Adversaries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of foes, each with unique abilities and strategies, requiring quick reflexes and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif5.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash Divine Powers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free imprisoned deities and harness their powers to enhance your abilities, granting new skills and advantages in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif1.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO Version:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this free version of the game, there are two playable Temples (of the Godesses: Nephthys and Isis). Many more coming in the full version, along with: better management/progression of your abilities; special levels; and an original soundtrack.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3174230?t=1748986966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748986966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/b857ad9815185eba163019d422cff0ba115311d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748986966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/b857ad9815185eba163019d422cff0ba115311d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748986966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic journey in the mystical world of Lana, where ancient secrets and formidable challenges await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a Vast and Mysterious World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse diverse landscapes, from sun-drenched deserts to enigmatic temples, each filled with hidden secrets and rich lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif4.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in Challenging Puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve intricate puzzles that blend logic and creativity, unlocking pathways and uncovering the mysteries of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif6.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Diverse Adversaries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a variety of foes, each with unique abilities and strategies, requiring quick reflexes and tactical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif5.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash Divine Powers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free imprisoned deities and harness their powers to enhance your abilities, granting new skills and advantages in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/extras/gif1.gif?t=1748986966\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEMO Version:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this free version of the game, there are two playable Temples (of the Godesses: Nephthys and Isis). Many more coming in the full version, along with: better management/progression of your abilities; special levels; and an original soundtrack.</p>","developers":["FADE REALMS"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3174020","name":"Lana: Queen of Ancient Egypt"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3174230/header.jpg?t=1748986966","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116395,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116395/movie480.mp4?t=1748986964","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116395/movie_max.mp4?t=1748986964"},"name":"Lana:Queen of Ancient Egypt","thumbnail":"https://shared.akama